# Terraform
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
# Environment tfvars ARE meant to be committed (reviewable, non-secret per-env config) —
# unlike an ad-hoc local terraform.tfvars, which stays ignored by the *.tfvars rule above.
!**/envs/*.tfvars
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
